      "content": "When therapeutic and self-care efforts aren't yielding results, it strongly suggests the burden you are carrying requires a different kind of support. The feeling of a completely \"broken\" capacity points to profound emotional fatigue, which deserves specialized attention. Please connect with a healthcare provider who can assess your overall well-being physically and mentally. You do not have to keep fighting this uphill battle alone; there are different kinds of help available.",
